  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_9048.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El Teatro M&oacute;naco de Onda ha registrado la noche de este s&aacute;bado un nuevo lleno absoluto&nbsp;de un p&uacute;blico que ha re&iacute;do y disfrutado de la comedia Conversaciones con mam&aacute;, con Juan Echanove y Mar&iacute;a Galiana, dirigida por el propio actor.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/teatrejuanechanovemariagaliana290314/img_9020.jpg\" alt=\"img_9020\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/teatrejuanechanovemariagaliana290314/img_9022.jpg\" alt=\"img_9022\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/teatrejuanechanovemariagaliana290314/img_9023.jpg\" alt=\"img_9023\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/teatrejuanechanovemariagaliana290314/img_9024.jpg\" alt=\"img_9024\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/teatrejuanechanovemariagaliana290314/img_9025.jpg\" alt=\"img_9025\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/teatrejuanechanovemariagaliana290314/img_9026.jpg\" alt=\"img_9026\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/teatrejuanechanovemariagaliana290314/img_9027.jpg\" alt=\"img_9027\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/teatrejuanechanovemariagaliana290314/img_9028.jpg\" alt=\"img_9028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/teatrejuanechanovemariagalian